  contactDamage: 1
  description: A patient eye in a bronze shell. Sentinels were the first of the host
    to look down and see YOU rather than a battlefield - and they have not looked
    away since.
  tactics: 'Descends slowly and fires single green bolts aimed at your position when
    it shoots. The bolt flies straight after launch: sidestep AFTER it fires, not
    before, or you dodge into the next one. Low HP - a priority target while it is
    still high on the screen.'
